title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对陈述及原书有限公理合取证明；翻译的内部逻辑保持采用 Fact 12"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,S_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S_0,S_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集；使用本册固定编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_1(z)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\">\\(\\sigma_1(z)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_1,g[S_1])\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_1,g[S_1])\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0\\unlhd S_1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\sigma_0\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_0,g[S_0])\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_1}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_0})\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0\\unlhd S_1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\sigma_0\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_0,g[S_0])\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_1}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_0})\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>取解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:S_0\\unlhd S_1\">\\(t:S_0\\unlhd S_1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 的 PR 双表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0(z)=\\sigma(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_1}(\\widehat t(z))\">\\(\\sigma_0(z)=\\sigma(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_1}(\\widehat t(z))\\)</span>。真实源公理的翻译在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1\">\\(S_1\\)</span> 中可证，故新公式仍在 PA 中 numerates 同一个源公理集。PA 内将有限用到的公理合取、翻译，并使用 Fact 12 的逻辑保持，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_0}(x)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_1}(\\widehat t(x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_0}(x)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_1}(\\widehat t(x))\\)</span>，从而得一致性转移。</p>\n<p>结论允许更换源理论的表示；它没有断言原来任取的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{S_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{S_0}\\)</span> 都能由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{S_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{S_1}\\)</span> 在 PA 内推出。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat t\">\\(\\widehat t\\)</span> 是固定标准编码下的 PR 翻译，不把公式对象当自然数直接传入内部可证性公式。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对陈述及原书有限公理合取证明；翻译的内部逻辑保持采用 Fact 12。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma_1(z)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]$，$\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_1,g[S_1]